container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.103ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 3139.4 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1055.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2055.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"78\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-78\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2583.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. The value of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.195ex\" height=\"0.975ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -431 528 431\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"78\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-78\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is ___________. (Nearest integer)</p>",
